Continue with [denormalization](/learning/dbms-sql-tutorial/denormalization) when a measured workload deliberately stores derived combinations. Preserve the authoritative independent facts and define how any redundant representation is maintained. A sound 4NF analysis states the full relation, nontrivial MVD, determinant key status and the domain argument supporting reconstruction.

## References

- [Database System Concepts: relational design teaching materials](https://www.db-book.com/slides-dir/index.html)' or heading is distinct from '4NF');
update public.learning_topics set short_description='Understand multivalued dependencies, test independent collections, distinguish BCNF from 4NF, and verify lossless decomposition without inventing relationship facts.',updated_at=now() where id=topic_uuid and short_description is distinct from 'Understand multivalued dependencies, test independent collections, distinguish BCNF from 4NF, and verify lossless decomposition without inventing relationship facts.';
update public.practice_tests set title='MCQ Test 1',question_count=10,total_marks=10,pass_marks=4,duration_minutes=10,description='Concepts and fundamentals for 4NF.',instructions='Answer all ten questions. One mark each; no negative marking.',updated_at=now() where id='pt-dbms-sql-21-4nf' and (title<>'MCQ Test 1' or question_count<>10 or total_marks<>10);
