if exists(select 1 from public.dsa_problems where id='cx-count-registration-measures' and description is distinct from 'Return total_rows,known_scores,distinct_students,passing_scores over registrations. Passing means score>=50. Unknown student identities do not count as distinct students.

**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
