if exists(select 1 from public.dsa_problems where id='cx-equipment-category-availability' and description is distinct from 'Return category_id, category_name, available_items for every category, including categories with no items or no available items. An item is available if no loan for that item has returned_on IS NULL. Count each item once regardless of returned history. Order by category_id.

**MySQL dialect.**

