```

**Required ordering:** Order by report_level, then known region labels before unknown-region label, then dimension_value.

**Edge cases:**
- Real NULL region contributes to product totals.
- Empty grouped input returns no rows.','[{"input": "INSERT INTO grouped_sales VALUES (1,NULL,''Widget'',10),(2,''East'',''Widget'',20),(3,''East'',''Gadget'',5);", "output": "report_level\tdimension_value\ttotal_amount\nproduct\tGadget\t5\nproduct\tWidget\t30\nregion\tEast\t25\nregion\t[unknown region]\t10", "explanation": "Tagged independent grains are wrapped in an outer query so an explicit sort key places the unknown-region display row last within region rows, independent of punctuation collation."}]'::jsonb,'[{"seed_sql": "INSERT INTO grouped_sales VALUES (1,NULL,''Widget'',0);", "expected": "report_level\tdimension_value\ttotal_amount\nproduct\tWidget\t0\nregion\t[unknown region]\t0", "hidden": true}, {"seed_sql": "", "expected": "", "hidden": true}]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'["Group raw region before applying its display label."]'::jsonb,'{"sql": "-- Write your SELECT query here\n"}'::jsonb,'Tagged independent grains are wrapped in an outer query so an explicit sort key places the unknown-region display row last within region rows, independent of punctuation collation.','{"sql": "SELECT report_level,dimension_value,total_amount FROM (SELECT ''region'' AS report_level,COALESCE(region,''[unknown region]'') AS dimension_value,SUM(amount) AS total_amount FROM grouped_sales GROUP BY region UNION ALL SELECT ''product'',product,SUM(amount) FROM grouped_sales GROUP BY product) AS report_rows ORDER BY report_level,CASE WHEN report_level=''region'' AND dimension_value=''[unknown region]'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END,dimension_value;"}'::jsonb,'Tagged independent grains are wrapped in an outer query so an explicit sort key places the unknown-region display row last within region rows, independent of punctuation collation.',array['sql'],'CREATE TABLE grouped_sales(order_id INT PRIMARY KEY,region VARCHAR(20),product VARCHAR(20),amount INT NOT NULL);','INSERT INTO grouped_sales VALUES (1,NULL,''Widget'',10),(2,''East'',''Widget'',20),(3,''East'',''Gadget'',5);',topic_uuid,parent.status,