**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
CREATE TABLE students(id INT PRIMARY KEY); CREATE TABLE enrollments(id INT PRIMARY KEY,student_id INT);
INSERT INTO students VALUES(1),(2); INSERT INTO enrollments VALUES(10,1),(11,1);
```

**Required ordering:** Ascending student id.

**Edge cases:**
