**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
CREATE TABLE products (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  name TEXT NOT NULL,
  category TEXT NOT NULL,
  price INTEGER NOT NULL
);
INSERT INTO products (id, name, category, price) VALUES
(1, ''ProLaptop'', ''Electronics'', 85000),
(2, ''Desk Lamp'', ''Home'', 900),
(3, ''ProPhone'', ''Electronics'', 45000),
(4, ''Python Basics'', ''Books'', 350),
(5, ''Novel'', ''Books'', 220),
(6, ''Headphones'', ''Electronics'', 3000),
(7, ''Rug'', ''Home'', 4500);
```

**Required ordering:** id ascending

**Edge cases:**
- Identifier gaps do not change the value boundary.
- An exhausted suffix returns no rows.','[{"input": "INSERT INTO products (id, name, category, price) VALUES\n(1, ''ProLaptop'', ''Electronics'', 85000),\n(2, ''Desk Lamp'', ''Home'', 900),\n(3, ''ProPhone'', ''Electronics'', 45000),\n(4, ''Python Basics'', ''Books'', 350),\n(5, ''Novel'', ''Books'', 220),\n(6, ''Headphones'', ''Electronics'', 3000),\n(7, ''Rug'', ''Home'', 4500);", "output": "id\tname\n4\tPython Basics\n5\tNovel\n6\tHeadphones", "explanation": "The first three identities greater than three are four, five and six in the sample. A suitable primary-key access plan can seek into this range; performance still requires measurement.", "check_sql": ""}]'::jsonb,'[{"seed_sql": "INSERT INTO products (id, name, category, price) VALUES\n(1, ''Tablet'', ''Electronics'', 20000),\n(2, ''Sofa'', ''Home'', 30000),\n(3, ''Speaker'', ''Electronics'', 5000),\n(4, ''Cookbook'', ''Books'', 400),\n(5, ''Chair'', ''Home'', 2500),\n(6, ''Mouse'', ''Electronics'', 900);", "expected": "id\tname\n4\tCookbook\n5\tChair\n6\tMouse", "hidden": true}, {"seed_sql": "INSERT INTO products VALUES (2,''Before'',''Lab'',1),(10,''Later'',''Lab'',2),(30,''Last'',''Lab'',3);", "expected": "id\tname\n10\tLater\n30\tLast", "hidden": true}, {"seed_sql": "INSERT INTO products VALUES (1,''Only'',''Lab'',1);", "expected": "", "hidden": true}]'::jsonb,'["Return at most three products.", "Preserve source identities and data."]'::jsonb,'["Exclude identifier 3 with a strict comparison.", "Order before taking the bounded result."]'::jsonb,'{"sql": "-- Write your SELECT query here\n"}'::jsonb,'The first three identities greater than three are four, five and six in the sample. A suitable primary-key access plan can seek into this range; performance still requires measurement.','{"sql": "SELECT id,name FROM products WHERE id>3 ORDER BY id ASC LIMIT 3;"}'::jsonb,'The first three identities greater than three are four, five and six in the sample. A suitable primary-key access plan can seek into this range; performance still requires measurement.',array['sql'],'CREATE TABLE products (
