if exists(select 1 from public.dsa_problems where id='cx-left-sessions-confirmed' and description is distinct from 'Return session_id, confirmed_count for every session. Only status confirmed qualifies. Count actual registrations and order by session_id.

**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
CREATE TABLE sessions(session_id INT PRIMARY KEY); CREATE TABLE registrations(registration_id INT PRIMARY KEY,session_id INT,status VARCHAR(12));
INSERT INTO sessions VALUES(1),(2),(3); INSERT INTO registrations VALUES(10,1,''confirmed''),(11,1,''cancelled''),(12,1,''confirmed''),(13,2,''cancelled'');
```

**Required ordering:** Order by session_id.

**Edge cases:**
