- [MySQL ANY, IN and SOME](https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/any-in-some-subqueries.html)
- [MySQL ALL](https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/all-subqueries.html)' or heading is distinct from 'Multiple Row Subquery');
