- [MySQL8.4 consistent nonlocking reads](https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/innodb-consistent-read.html)
- [MySQL8.4 isolation levels](https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/innodb-transaction-isolation-levels.html)' or heading is distinct from 'Nonrepeatable Read');
