if exists(select 1 from public.dsa_problems where id='cx-scalar-confirmed-count' and description is distinct from 'Return instructor_id, confirmed_count for every instructor using a scalar correlated aggregate. Only status confirmed counts. Order by instructor_id.

**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
