INSERT INTO instructors VALUES(1),(2),(3); INSERT INTO sessions VALUES(1,1,''confirmed''),(2,1,''confirmed''),(3,2,''cancelled''),(4,NULL,''confirmed'');
```

**Required ordering:** Order by instructor_id.

**Edge cases:**
- No child rows.
