- [MySQL CREATE VIEW](https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/create-view.html)
- [MySQL updatable views](https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/view-updatability.html)' or heading is distinct from 'Simple Views');
