**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
CREATE TABLE trigger_items(item_id INT PRIMARY KEY,label VARCHAR(40) NULL) ENGINE=InnoDB; CREATE TABLE staged_items(item_id INT PRIMARY KEY,label VARCHAR(40) NULL) ENGINE=InnoDB;
INSERT INTO staged_items VALUES(1,'' Camera ''),(2,''Desk lamp''),(3,NULL);
```

**Required ordering:** Order by item_id.

**Edge cases:**
- Surrounding spaces.
- An internal space is preserved.
- NULL.
- No staged rows.','[{"input": "INSERT INTO staged_items VALUES(1,'' Camera ''),(2,''Desk lamp''),(3,NULL);", "output": "item_id\tlabel\n1\tCamera\n2\tDesk lamp\n3\tNULL", "explanation": "Each inserted row is normalized through NEW; NULL and internal spaces remain as specified."}]'::jsonb,'[{"seed_sql": "INSERT INTO staged_items VALUES(4,'' Tripod '');", "expected": "item_id\tlabel\n4\tTripod", "hidden": true}, {"seed_sql": "", "expected": "", "hidden": true}]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'["Create the trigger before the actual insert."]'::jsonb,'{"sql": "-- Write your SELECT query here\n"}'::jsonb,'Each inserted row is normalized through NEW; NULL and internal spaces remain as specified.','{"sql": "CREATE TRIGGER trim_item_label BEFORE INSERT ON trigger_items FOR EACH ROW SET NEW.label=TRIM(NEW.label); INSERT INTO trigger_items SELECT item_id,label FROM staged_items; SELECT item_id,label FROM trigger_items ORDER BY item_id;"}'::jsonb,'Each inserted row is normalized through NEW; NULL and internal spaces remain as specified.',array['sql'],'CREATE TABLE trigger_items(item_id INT PRIMARY KEY,label VARCHAR(40) NULL) ENGINE=InnoDB; CREATE TABLE staged_items(item_id INT PRIMARY KEY,label VARCHAR(40) NULL) ENGINE=InnoDB;','INSERT INTO staged_items VALUES(1,'' Camera ''),(2,''Desk lamp''),(3,NULL);',topic_uuid,parent.status,parent.is_premium,parent.show_on_website,parent.show_on_mobile,0 from public.practice_tests parent where parent.id='cx-trigger-row-events-and-failures-fundamentals' on conflict(id) do nothing;
