**Edge cases:**
- Empty input returns no detail rows.
- Include equal values on different source rows.
- Verify boundary and NULL handling when the schema permits them.','[{"input": "INSERT INTO morning VALUES (1,20),(2,20); INSERT INTO evening VALUES (1,20),(2,30);", "output": "channel\tid\tamount\nevening\t1\t20\nevening\t2\t30\nmorning\t1\t20\nmorning\t2\t20", "explanation": "The solution implements the stated row selection and preserves the requested result grain; the final ordering makes comparisons deterministic."}]'::jsonb,'[{"seed_sql": "INSERT INTO morning VALUES (1,7);", "expected": "channel\tid\tamount\nmorning\t1\t7", "hidden": true}]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'["Determine the result grain before writing the query.", "Use explicit projected columns and a final ORDER BY."]'::jsonb,'{"sql": "-- Write your SELECT query here\n"}'::jsonb,'The solution implements the stated row selection and preserves the requested result grain; the final ordering makes comparisons deterministic.','{"sql": "SELECT ''morning'' AS channel,id,amount FROM morning UNION ALL SELECT ''evening'',id,amount FROM evening ORDER BY channel,id;"}'::jsonb,'The solution implements the stated row selection and preserves the requested result grain; the final ordering makes comparisons deterministic.',array['sql'],'CREATE TABLE morning (id INT PRIMARY KEY, amount INT); CREATE TABLE evening (id INT PRIMARY KEY, amount INT);','INSERT INTO morning VALUES (1,20),(2,20); INSERT INTO evening VALUES (1,20),(2,30);',topic_uuid,parent.status,parent.is_premium,parent.show_on_website,parent.show_on_mobile,0 from public.practice_tests parent where parent.id='pt-dbms-sql-18-union-all' on conflict(id) do nothing;
