- [PostgreSQL constraints and relational integrity](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ddl-constraints.html)
- [MySQL foreign keys](https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/create-table-foreign-keys.html)' or heading is distinct from 'Update Anomaly');
